	 * Sets the certificate in ARG1 as the explicit recipient encryption certificate. Use the CreateCS, CertStore, and Cert classes to obtain a Cert object by locating a certificate in a certificate store or loading one from a file.
	 * @see https://www.chilkatsoft.com/refdoc/phpCkEmailRef.html#SetEncryptCert
	 * @param CkCert $cert
	 * @return bool
